  m_text: "At EverGreen Goods, we believe every choice we make can shape a healthier,
    more sustainable world. From the food we eat to the products we use every day,
    quality and care matter. That\u2019s why we partner with local farms, ethical
    growers, and responsible suppliers who share our commitment to purity, transparency,
    and respect for the planet. When you shop with EverGreen Goods, you\u2019re choosing
    products that nourish your body and honor the Earth."
